sequenceDiagram
    participant CI as CI/CD Pipeline
    participant Extractor as model-extractor<br/>Go CLI
    participant HF as HuggingFace API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GH as GitHub API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registries<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant FS as data/ Directory<br/>YAML Files
    participant Report as metadata-report<br/>Go CLI
    participant Build as Container Build<br/>Dockerfile.konflux
    participant Sidecar as Data Sidecar<br/>sleep infinity
    participant Platform as RHOAI Components

    Note over CI,Platform: Phase 1: CI/CD Metadata Collection

    CI->>Extractor: Execute model-extractor
    Note right of Extractor: Optional: HF_TOKEN env var

    Extractor->>HF: GET /api/collections<br/>Bearer Token (optional)
    HF-->>Extractor: Model collections JSON

    Extractor->>HF: GET /api/models/{id}<br/>Bearer Token (optional)
    HF-->>Extractor: Model cards, enrichment data

    Note right of Extractor: Optional: GITHUB_TOKEN env var

    Extractor->>GH: GET /repos/{owner}/{repo}<br/>Bearer Token (optional)
    GH-->>Extractor: Agent metadata, README files

    Extractor->>OCI: GET manifests<br/>Registry credential chain
    OCI-->>Extractor: Image architecture info

    Extractor->>FS: Write YAML catalogs<br/>(models, agents, MCP servers)
    Extractor->>FS: Write index files

    CI->>Report: Execute metadata-report
    Report->>FS: Read generated YAML data
    FS-->>Report: Catalog data
    Report->>FS: Write completeness reports

    Note over CI,Platform: Phase 2: Container Image Build

    CI->>Build: docker build -f Dockerfile.konflux
    Build->>FS: COPY data/ files
    Build->>Sidecar: Package as /app/data<br/>Base: ubi-minimal-pqc<br/>User: 1001

    Note over CI,Platform: Phase 3: Runtime Data Serving

    Platform->>Sidecar: Mount /app/data volume
    Sidecar-->>Platform: YAML catalog data<br/>(static, read-only)
